### Context & Goal
We are building a Chrome Extension framework (Manifest V3) for a B2B procurement platform. The extension's job is to:
1. Retrieve authenticated, contract-specific pricing from scientific vendors (e.g., Fisher Scientific, VWR, Abcam) while the user is logged into their accounts.
2. Automate adding items directly to those vendors' carts natively.

### Architectural Strategy
To avoid breaking the extension every time a vendor updates their UI, we are using a **Dynamic Remote Configuration Engine**. The extension itself acts as a "dumb engine." It downloads a JSON configuration file from our backend that tells it exactly which endpoints to hit, how to extract security tokens (like CSRF tokens), what headers to pass, and how to map the response data. 

Because the background Service Worker has explicit `host_permissions`, it bypasses CORS and automatically attaches the user's active session cookies to these vendor requests, enabling us to fetch authenticated contract pricing safely.



### Target JSON Schema Blueprint
Your output configuration MUST match this exact schema structure:

```json
{
  "vendor_id": "string (e.g., vwr, fisher)",
  "domain_matchers": ["*://*[.vendor.com/](https://.vendor.com/)*"],
  "pricing": {
    "enabled": true,
    "method": "GET or POST",
    "url_template": "[https://api.vendor.com/v1/products/](https://api.vendor.com/v1/products/){{SKU}}/pricing",
    "token_extraction": {
      "required": true,
      "source": "DOM_ATTRIBUTE | COOKIE | WINDOW_VARIABLE | PRE_FLIGHT_REQUEST",
      "locator_key": "meta[name='csrf-token']", 
      "header_name": "X-CSRF-Token"
    },
    "headers": {
      "Accept": "application/json",
      "Content-Type": "application/json"
    },
    "response_mapping": {
      "contract_price_path": "$.data.pricing.contractPrice",
      "list_price_path": "$.data.pricing.listPrice",
      "currency_path": "$.data.pricing.currency",
      "availability_path": "$.inventory[0].status"
    }
  },
  "add_to_cart": {
    "enabled": true,
    "method": "POST",
    "url_template": "[https://api.vendor.com/v1/cart/items](https://api.vendor.com/v1/cart/items)",
    "token_extraction": {
      "required": true,
      "source": "COOKIE",
      "locator_key": "XSRF-TOKEN",
      "header_name": "X-XSRF-TOKEN"
    },
    "payload_template": {
      "sku": "{{SKU}}",
      "quantity": "{{QTY}}",
      "catalogNumber": "{{SKU}}"
    },
    "success_indicator": {
      "status_code": 200,
      "json_path": "$.success",
      "expected_value": true
    }
  },
  "throttling": {
    "concurrency_limit": 3,
    "min_jitter_ms": 500,
    "max_jitter_ms": 1500
  }
}